Phase PlanLast updated: October 12, 2026 | Current: Phase 30 — Mobile Carousel Arrow Navigation**Current Phase: Phase 30 — Mobile Carousel Arrow Navigation**---## Phase 30: Mobile Carousel Arrow Navigation (COMPLETE)**Completed:**- [x] Removed `display: none` from `.carousel-btn` in the `@media (max-width: 768px)` block so the left/right arrows render on mobile- [x] Repositioned arrows for small screens: `.carousel-btn-prev { left: 10px }` / `.carousel-btn-next { right: 10px }` — the desktop's `-24px` offsets would sit half-off the viewport since the page wrapper only has `px-6` (24px) padding- [x] Strengthened the mobile arrow shadow (`0 6px 20px` at 28% foreground) so the buttons stay readable overlaid on the card surface- [x] Arrows call the same `goToPrev`/`goToNext` handlers, so tapping them swaps the card and stops auto-rotation (consistent with swipe and dot indicators)- [x] ESLint: 0 errors on `ToolsCarousel.js`- [x] `next build`: passes (46/46 static pages prerendered)